# Single-cell RNA-seq Analysis Report

**Author:** Dr. Divya Mishra, Ph.D.

## Overview
This report presents a complete single-cell RNA-seq analysis including
quality control, clustering, cell type annotation, differential expression,
and pathway enrichment.

## Methods
- Scanpy-based preprocessing and clustering
- Leiden clustering and UMAP visualization
- Differential expression using Wilcoxon test
- Pathway enrichment using GSEA (gseapy)

